  "steps": [
    "Brown the ground beef in a 10-quart pot over medium heat.",
    "While the beef cooks, stir in the Worcestershire sauce, tomato paste, sausage, onion, jalapenos and chili seasoning packets.",
    "Once the meat is fully cooked, add the fire-roasted tomatoes, diced tomatoes, tomato sauce, beef broth and garlic.",
    "Stir well, cover, and simmer on medium-low for 1 hour.",
    "Stir in the chili beans and mustard until well combined.",
    "Cover and simmer on low for at least 30 more minutes.",
    "Serve with a splash of hot pepper sauce and crackers if you like."
